  "id": "4304768dac617239e03fb9fd546ed366",
  "name": {
   "zh": "深度与摄影机 · Pi3",
   "en": "Depth and Camera · Pi3"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Pi3 官方自述：全置换等变的前馈网络，不依赖固定参考帧，从无序的一组画面预测仿射不变的摄影机位姿和尺度不变的局部点图，升级后的 Pi3X 可得接近真实尺度。这张卡交付每帧摄影机（USD 与 Nuke 摄影机）、深度贴图和点云；点云是每帧一张点图、各在这一帧自己的摄影机里，官方没有合成一份场景点云的输出。",
   "en": "Pi3 is a fully permutation-equivariant feed-forward network that needs no fixed reference frame, predicting affine-invariant camera poses and scale-invariant local pointmaps from unordered images; the upgraded Pi3X comes close to metric scale. This card delivers per-frame cameras (USD and Nuke camera), depth maps and point clouds, one pointmap per frame in that frame's own camera."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "depth_camera",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
